hadiths[136]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2464","main abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ke makan mein logon ko sharab pilaa raha tha. un dinon khajoor hi ki sharab piyaa kartey they. (phir junhii sharab ki hurmat par Quran ki aayat utri ( to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik munaadii se eilaan karaya ke sharab haram ho gaee hai. unhon-ne kaha (ye suntey hi ( abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke bahar ley ja kar us sharab ko baha de. chunanche maine bahar nikal kar saari sharab baha di. sharab Madina ki galiyon mein bahney lagii, to kuchh logon ne kaha, yun malum hota hai ke bahut se log us haalat mein qatl kar diye gaey hain ke sharab unke pet mein maujood thi. phir Allah Taala ne ye aayat nazil farmai (ليس على الذين آمنوا وعملوا الصالحات جناح فيما طعموا) ''wo log jo eman laey aur amale-Saaleh kiye, un par un chizon ka koi gunah nahi hai. jo pahley kha chukey hain ( aakhir aayat tak) ."
"2465","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya raston mein baithney se bacho. sahaba ne arz kya ke ham to wahan baithney par majbur hain. wahi hamarey baithney ki jagah hoti hai ke jahan ham baatein kartey hain. is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke agar wahan baithney ki majboorii hi hai to rastey ka haq bhi ada karo. sahaba ne puchha aur rastey ka haq kya hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, nigaah neechi rakhna, kisi ko takleef deney se bachnaa, salam ka jawab denaa, achi baton ke liye logon ko hukm karna aur buri baton se roknaa."
"2466","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, aik shakhs rastey main safar kar raha tha ke usey piyaas lagi phir usey rastey mein aik kunwaan mila aur wo uske andar utar gaya aur pani piyaa. jab bahar aaya to uski nazar aik kuttey par padi jo haanp raha tha aur piyaas ki sakhti se keechad chaat raha tha. us shakhs ne sochaa ke us waqt ye kutta bhi piyaas ki itni hi shiddat mein mubtala hai jis mein main tha. chunanche wo phir kuwein mein utra aur apne jootey mein pani bhar kar us ne kuttey ko pilaayaa. Allah Taala ke yahan uska ye amal maqbool hua aur uski maghfirat kar di gaee. sahaba ne poochha, ya Rasulullah kya janwaron ke silsile mein bhi hamein ajr milta hai? to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan, har jaandaar makhlooq ke silsiley mein ajr milta hai."
"2467","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Madina ke aik buland makan par chadhey . phir farmaya, kya tum log bhi dekh rahe ho jo main dekh raha hun ke (an-qareeb) tumharey gharon mein fitney is tarah baras rahe hongey jaisey barish barastii hai."
"2468","mein hamesha is baat ka aarzu-mand rehta tha ke umr (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki un 2 beeviyon ke naam poochhoon jinke barey mein Allah Taala ne ( sura Tahreem mein) farmaya hai) إن تتوبا إلى الله فقد صغت قلوبكما‏ ( ''agar tum donon Allah ke samney tauba karo (to behtar hai) ke tumharey dil bigad gaey hain.'' phir main unke sath Haj ko gaya. umr (Raziallahu anhu) rastey se qazaey-hajat (zaroorat se farigh honey) ke liye hatey to main bhi unke sath (paanii ka eik) chhaagal lekar gaya. phir wo qazaey-hajat (zaroorat se farigh honey) ke liye chaley gaey aur jab wapas aaey to maine unke donon hathon par chhaagal se pani daala aur unhon-ne wuzu kya, phir maine poochha, ya ameerul-momineen ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beeviyon mein wo 2 khawaateen kon si hain jinke mutaalliq Allah Taala ne ye farmaya ke) إن تتوبا إلى الله‏ ( ''tum donon Allah ke samney tauba karo '' unhon-ne farmaya, Ibne-Abbas ! tum par hairat hai. wo to Aaisha aur Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) hain. phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) meri taraf mutwajjeh ho kar pura waqia bayan karne lagey. aap ne batlaya ke banu-Umaiya bin Zaid ke qabeeley mein jo Madina se mila hua tha. main apne aik Ansari padosi ke sath rehta tha. ham donon ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein haziri ki baari muqarrar kar rakhi thi. aik din wo hazir hotey aur aik din main. jab main haziri deta to us din ki tamam khabrein wghaira laataa (aur unko sunata (aur jab wo hazir hotey to wo bhi isi tarah kartey. ham Quraish ke log (Makka mein) apni aurton par ghalib raha kartey they. lekin jab ham ( hijrat karke ( Ansar ke yahan aaey to unhein dekha ke unki auratein khud un par ghalib thin. hamari aurton ne bhi unka tariqa ikhtiyar karna shuru kar diya. maine aik din apni biwi ko daantaa to unhon-ne bhi iska jawab diya. unka ye jawab mujhey na-gawar malum hua. lekin unhon-ne kaha ke main agar jawab deti hun to tumhen na-gawari kyon hoti hai. qism Allah ki! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beeviyan tak aapko jawab de deti hain aur kuchh beeviyan to aap se poorey din aur poori raat khafa rehti hain. is baat se main bahut ghabraayaa aur maine kaha ke unmein se jisne bhi aisa kya hoga wo bahut badey nuqsan aur khasaarey mein hai. iske baad maine kapdey pahney aur Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ( umr (Raziallahu anhu) ki sahibzadi aur Ummul-Momenin (ke paas pahuncha aur kaha aey Hafsa ! kya tum mein se koi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poorey din-raat tak naraz rehti hain. unhon-ne kaha ke haan! main bol utha ke phir to wo tabahi aur nuqsan mein rahiin. kya tumhen us se amn hai ke Allah Taala apne rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki narazgi ki wjah se (tum par) ghussa ho jaey aur tum halaak ho jao . Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se zyada chizon ka mutalba hargiz na kya karo, na kisi maamle mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki kisi baat ka jawab do aur na aap par narazgi ka izhar honey do, albatta jis cheez ki tumhen zarurat ho, wo mujh se maang liya karo, kisi khud faraibi mein mubtala na rehna, tumhari ye padausan tum se zyada jameel aur naazuk hain aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko zyada pyari bhi hain. aap ki murad Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se thi. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, un dinon ye charcha ho raha tha ke ghassaan ke fauji ham se ladney ke liye ghodon ko sum laga rahe hain. mere padosi aik din apni baari par Madina gaey huey they. phir isha ke waqt wapas lautey. aa kar mera darwaza unhon-ne badi zor se khatkhataayaa, aur kaha kya aap so gaey hain? main bahut ghabraayaa hua bahar aaya unhon-ne kaha ke aik bahut bada haadisa pesh aa gaya hai. maine puchha kya hua? kya ghassaan ka lashkar aa gayaa? unhon-ne kaha balke us se bhi bada aur sangeen haadisa, wo ye ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni beeviyon ko talaaq de di. ye sun kar umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne farmaya, Hafsa to tabah w barbad ho gaee. mujhey to pahley hi khatkaa tha ke kahin aisa na ho jaey (Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha) phir maine kapdey pahney. subah ki Namaz Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath padhi (namaz padhtey hi) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne bula khaana mein tashrif le gaey aur wahin tanhai ikhtiyar kar li. main Hafsa ke yahan gaya, dekha to wo ro rahi thin, maine kaha, ro kyon rahi ho? kya pahley hi maine tumhen nahi keh diya tha? kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne tum sab ko talaaq de di hai? unhon-ne kaha ke mujhey kuchh malum nahi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baalaa-khaane mein tashrif rakhtey hain. phir main bahar nikla aur member ke paas aaya. wahan kuchh log maujood they aur kuchh ro bhi rahe they. thodi der to main unke sath betha raha. lekin mujh par ranj ka ghalba hua, aur main baalaa-khaaney ke paas pahuncha, jis mein Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif rakhtey they. maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke aik siyah ghulam se kaha, (ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaho (ke umr ijazat chahta hai. wo ghulam andar gaya aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se guftgu karke wapas aaya aur kaha ke maine aap ki baat pahuncha di thi, lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khamosh ho gaey, chunanche main wapas aa kar unhiin logon ke sath baith gaya jo member ke paas maujood they. phir mujh par ranj ghalib aaya aur main dobara aaya. lekin us baar bhi wahi hua. phir aa kar unhiin logon mein baith gaya jo member ke paas they. lekin us martaba phir mujh se nahi raha gaya aur maine ghulam se aa kar kaha, ke umr ke liye ijazat chaaho. lekin baat joon ki toon rahi. jab main wapas ho raha tha ke ghulam ne mujh ko pukara aur kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aapko ijazat de di hai. main Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khajoor ki chatai par letey huey they. jis par koi bistar bhi nahi tha. isliye chatai ke ubhrey huey hisson ka nishan Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke pahlu mein pad gaya tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt aik aisey takiye par tek lagaey huey they jiske andar khajoor ki chhaal bhari gaee thi. maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko salam kya aur khadey hi khadey arz ki, ke kya aap ne apni beeviyon ko talaaq de di hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne nigaah meri taraf karke farmaya ke nahi. maine aap ke gham ko halka karne ki koshish ki aur kehney laga. . . . ab bhi main khada hi tha. . . . ya Rasulullah ! aap jantey hi hain ke ham Quraish ke log apni beeviyon par ghalib rahtey they, lekin jab ham aik aisi qaum mein aagey jinki auratein un par ghalib thin, phir umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne tafseel zikr ki. is baat par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) muskuraa diye. phir maine kaha, main Hafsa ke yahan bhi gaya tha aur us se keh aaya tha ke kahin kisi khud faraibi mein na mubtala rehna. ye tumhari padausan tum se zyada khoobsurat aur paak hain aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko zyada mahboob bhi hain. aap Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki taraf ishara kar rahe they. is baat par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) dobara muskuraa diye. jab maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko muskuratey dekha, to (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas ( baith gaya aur aap ke ghar mein charon taraf dekhney laga. b-khudaa ! siwaey teen khaalon ke aur koi cheez wahan nazar na aai. maine kaha, ya Rasulullah ! aap Allah Taala se dua farmaiye ke wo aap ki ummat ko kushadgi ata farma de. Faaris aur Rome (mojooda Itly) ke log to poori faraakhii ke sath rahtey hain. duniya unhein khub mili hui hai. halanke wo Allah Taala ki ibadat bhi nahi kartey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tek lagaey huey they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, aey khttaab ke betey! kya tumhen abhi kuchh shuba hai? (tu duniya ki daulat ko achi samajhta hai) ye to aisey log hain ke unke achchhey aamaal (jo wo maamlaat ki had tak kartey hain unki jazaa) isi duniya mein unko de di gaee hai. (ye sun kar) main bol utha . ya Rasulullah ! mere liye Allah se maghfirat ki dua kijiye . to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (apni beeviyon se) is baat par alehadgii ikhtiyar kar li thi ke Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ne posheeda baat keh di thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us intihai narazgi ki wjah se jo Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko hui thi, farmaya tha ke main ab unke paas aik mahiney tak nahi jaaunga aur yahi mauqa hai jis par Allah Taala ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko mutanabbeh (aagaah) kya tha. phir jab untees din guzar gaey to aap Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke ghar tashrif le gaey aur unhiin ke yahan se Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne shuruaat ki. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ke aap ne to ahad kya tha ke hamarey yahan aik mahiney tak nahi tashrif laaengey aur aaj abhi untiswin ki subah hai. main to din gin rahi thi. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, ye mahina untees din ka hai aur wo mahina untees hi din ka tha. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke phir wo aayat nazil hui jis mein (nabi ki beeviyon ko) ikhtiyar diya gaya tha. uski bhi shuruaat Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh hi se ki aur farmaya ke main tum se aik baat kehta hun, aur ye zaroori nahi ke jawab fauran do, balke apne waalidain se bhi mashwara kar lo. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke aapko ye malum tha ke mere maan-baap kabhi aap se judai ka mashwara nahi de saktey. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Taala ne farmaya hai ke ''aey nabii! apni beeviyon se keh do'' Allah Taala ke qaul عظیما tak. maine arz kya kya ab us mamley mein bhi main apne waalidain se mashwara karne jaaungii! usmein to kisi shubeh ki gunjaaish hi nahi hai. ke main Allah aur uske rasool aur daare-aakhirat ko pasand karti hun. iske baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni dusri beeviyon ko bhi ikhtiyar diya aur unhon-ne bhi wahi jawab diya jo Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne diya tha."
"2469","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni beeviyon ke paas aik mahina tak na janey ki qism khaaii thi, aur (iilaa ke waqia se pahley 5 H mein) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke qadam Mubarak mein moch aa gaee thi aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne bula khaane mein thahre huey huey they. (iilaa ke mauqe par) umr (Raziallahu anhu) aaey aur arz kya, ya Rasulullah! kya aap ne apni beeviyon ko talaaq de di hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi. albatta aik mahiney ke liye unke paas na janey ki qism kha li hai. chunanche Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) untees din tak beeviyon ke paas nahi gaey (aur untees taareekh ko hi chaand ho gaya tha) isliye Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baalaa-khaaney se utrey aur beeviyon ke paas gaey."
"2470","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) masjid mein tashrif rakhtey they. isliye main bhi masjid ke andar chala gaya. albatta oont balaat ke aik kinarey par baandh diya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se maine arz kya ke ya Rasulullah ! aap ka oont hazir hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bahar tashrif laey aur oont ke charon taraf tahalney lagey. phir farmaya ke qeemat bhi ley aur oont bhi ley jaa."
"2471","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko dekha, ya ye kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik qaum ki koodi par tashrif laaey, aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wahan khadey ho kar peshab kya."
"2472","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, aik shakhs rastey par chal raha tha ke usne wahan kaantey daar dali dekhi. us ne usey utha liya to Allah Taala ne uska ye amal qabool kya aur uski maghfirat kar di."
"2473","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne faisla kya tha jabke rastey (ki zameen) ke barey mein jhagdaa ho to saat (7) hath rasta chhod dena chahiye"
"2474","maine Abdullah-bin Yazeed Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) se suna, jo Adii-bin-Saabit ke naana they. ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne loot-maar karne aur musla karne se mana farmaya tha."
"2475","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, zaanii momin rahtey huey zina nahi kar sakta. sharab peeneywaalaa momin rahtey huey sharab nahi pi sakta. chor momin rahtey huey chori nahi kar sakta aur koi shakhs momin rahtey huey loot aur ghaarat garii nahi kar sakta ke logon ki nazrein uski taraf uthi hui hon aur wo lot raha ho, Saeed aur abu-Salma ki bhi Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) se b-hawaala Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) isi tarah riwayat hai, albatta unki riwayat mein loot ka tazkira nahi hai."
"2476","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, qiyamat us waqt tak qaaim na hogi jab tak ibne-Maryam ka nuzool aik aadil hukmaraan ki haisiyat se tum mein na ho jaey. wo saleeb ko tod dengey, suwaron ko qatl kar dengey aur jiziya qabool nahi karengey. (us daur mein) maal w daulat ki itni kasarat ho jaeygi ke koi qabool nahi karega."
"2477","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Khaibar ki jang ke mauqe par dekha ke aag jalaaii ja rahi hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne puchha ye aag kis liye jalaaii ja rahi hai? sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya ke gadhey (ka gosht pakaaney (ke liye. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo bartan (jis mein gadhey ka gosht ho ( tod 2 aur gosht phenk do. is par sahaba boley aisa kyon na kar lein ke gosht to phenk dein aur bartan dho lein. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke bartan dho lo. abu-Adbullah."
"2478","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) (fatah Makka ke din jab) Makka mein dakhil huey to khaana Kaba ke charon taraf 360 but they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hath mein aik chhadi thi jis se Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) un buton par maarney lagey aur farmaney lagey ke (جاء الحق وزهق الباطل) '' haq aa gaya aur baatil mit gaya '' ."
"2479","unhon-ne apne hujrey ke saaybaan par aik parda latkaa diya jis mein tasweerein bani hui thin. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne (jab dekha to) usey utaar kar phaad dala. (Aaisha (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya ke) phir maine us pardey se 2 gaddey bana daley. wo donon gaddey ghar mein rahtey they aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) un par betha kartey they."
"2480","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs apne maal ki hifazat kartey huey qatl kar diya gaya wo Shahid hai."
"2481","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) paak beeviyon mein se kisi aik ke yahan tashrif rakhtey they. ummahaatul momeneen (nabi ki beeviyon) mein se aik ne wahin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke liye khaadim ke hath aik pyaley mein kuchh khaney ki cheez bhijwaai . unhon-ne aik hath us pyaley par maaraa, aur piyala ( gir kar) toot gaya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne pyaley ko joda aur jo khaney ki cheez thi usmein dobara rakh kar sahaba se farmaya ke khaao. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne piyala laney waley (khaadim ( ko rok liya aur piyala bhi nahi bhejaa. balke jab ( khaney se) sab farigh ho gaey to doosra achchha piyala bhijwa diya aur jo toot gaya tha usey nahi bhijwaayaa. ibne-abii-Maryam ne bayan kya ke hamein Yahyaa-bin-Ayyoob ne khabar di, unse Humaid ne bayan kya, unse Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne bayan kya aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne."
"2482","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, Bani-Israeel mein aik sahib they, jinka naam Juraij tha. wo Namaz padh rahe they ke unki walida aaiin aur unhein pukaaraa. unhon-ne jawab nahi diya. sochtey rahe ke jawab dun ya Namaz padhun. phir wo dobara aaiin aur (ghussey mein) baddua kar gaiin. aey Allaah! usey maut na aaey jab tak kisi badkaar aurat ka munh na dekh ley. Juraij apne ibadat khaney mein rahtey they. aik aurat ne (jo Juraij ke ibadat khaney ke paas apni maweshii charaayaa karti thi aur faahisha thi) kaha ke Juraij ko fitna mein daley baghair na rahoongii. chunanche wo unke samney aai aur guftgu karni chaahii, lekin unhon-ne munh pher liya. phir wo aik charwaahey ke paas gaee aur apne jism ko uske qaabu mein de diya. aakhir ladka paida hua aur us aurat ne ilzam lagaya ke ye Juraij ka ladka hai. qaum ke log Juraij ke yahan aaey aur unka ibadat khaana tod diya. unhein bahar nikala aur gaaliyaan din. lekin Juraij ne wuzu kya aur Namaz padh kar us ladkey ke paas aaey. unhon-ne us se poochha. bachchey! tumhara bap kon hai? bachcha ( Allah ke hukm se) bol padaa ke charwaahaa! (qaum khush ho gaee aur) kaha ke ham aap ke liye soney ka ibadat khaana banwaa dein. Juraij ne kaha ke mera ghar to mitti hi se banega."
"2483","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( rajab 7 hijri mein) saahil bahar ki taraf aik lashkar bheja aur iska ameer abu-Ubaida bin-Jarraah (Raziallahu anhu) ko banaya. faujiyon ki tadaad teen so thi aur main bhi unmein Sharik tha. ham nikley aur abhi rastey hi mein they ke khane-pine ka saman khatm ho gaya. abu-Ubaida (Raziallahu anhu) ne hukm diya ke tamam fauji apne toshey (jo kuchh bhi baqi reh gaey hon) aik jagah jama kar dein. sab kuchh jama karne ke baad khajooron ke kal 2 thailey ho sakey aur rozaana hamein usi mein se thodi thodi khajoor khaney ke liye milney lagi jab iska bhi aksar hissey khatm ho gaya to hamein sirf eik-eik khajoor miltii rahi. main (wahab-bin-Kaisaan) ne Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) se kaha bhala aik khajoor se kya hota hoga? unhon-ne batlaya ke uski qadr hamein us waqt malum hui jab wo bhi khatm ho gaee thi. unhon-ne bayan kya ke aakhir ham samandar tak pahunch gaey. ittifaq se samandar mein hamein aik aisi machhli mil gaee jo (apne jism mein) pahaad ki tarah malum hoti thi. Sara lashkar us machhli ko atthaara raaton tak khata raha. phir abu-Ubaida (Raziallahu anhu) ne uski donon pasliyon ko khada karne ka hukm diya. uske baad oonton ko unke taley se chalney ka hukm diya aur wo un pasliyon ke nichey se ho kar guzrey, lekin oont ne unko chhuwa tak nahi."
"2484","( jange-Hawaazin mein) logon ke toshey khatm ho gaey aur faqr w mohtaajii aa gaee, to log Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey. apne oonton ko zabah karne ki ijazat leney (taake unhiin ke gosht se pet bhar sakein) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein ijazat de di. rastey mein umr (Raziallahu anhu) ki mulaqat unse ho gaee to unhein bhi un logon ne itlaa di. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha oonton ko kaat daalogey to phir tum kaisey zinda rahogey. chunanche aap Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur kaha, ya Rasulullah! agar unhon-ne oont bhi zabah kar liye to phir ye log kaisey zinda rahengey. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke achchha, tamam logon mein elaan kar do ke unke paas jo kuchh toshey bach rahe hain wo lekar yahan aa jaaein. uske liye aik chamdey ka dastar-khuwaan bichhaa diya gaya aur logon ne toshey usi dastar-khuwaan par la kar rakh diye. uske baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) uthey aur is mein barkat ki dua farmai. ab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne phir sab logon ko apne apney bartanon ke sath bulaya aur sab ne donon hathon se toshey apne bartanon mein bhar liye. jab sab log bhar chukey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''main gawahi deta hun ke Allah ke siwa koi maabood nahi aur ye ke main Allah ka sachcha rasool hoon.''"
"2485","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Asr ki Namaz padh kar oont zabah kartey to unhein das hisson mein taqseem kartey aur phir suraj ghurub honey se pahley hi ham iska pakka hua gosht bhi kha letey."
"2486","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, qabila ash'ar ke logon ka jab jihad ke mauqe par khane-pine ka saman kam ho jata ya Madina (ke qiyaam) mein unke baal bachchon ke liye khaney ki kami ho jati to jo kuchh bhi unke paas khane-pine ka saman hota to wo aik kapdey mein jama kar letey hain. phir aapas mein aik bartan se barabar taqseem kar letey hain. to wo mere hain aur main unka hun."
"2487","Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne unke liye farz zakat ka bayan tahreer kya tha jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne muqarrar ki thi. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab kisi maal mein 2 aadmi saajhii hon to wo zakat mein aik doosrey se barabar barabar mujraa kar lein (yani zakat ki raqam aapas mein barabar taqseem kar lein)."
"2488","ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath maqam zul-Hulaifa mein thahrey huey they. logon ko bhook lagi idhar ( ghaneemat mein) oont aur bakriyan mili thin. unhon-ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) lashkar ke peechhey ke logon mein they. logon ne jaldi ki aur) taqseem se pahley hi ( zabah karke haandiyaan chadhaa din. lekin baad main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne hukm diya aur wo haandiyaan aundha di gaiin. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unko taqseem kya aur das bakriyon ko aik oont ke barabar rakha. aik oont usmein se bhag gaya to log usey pakadney ki koshish karne lagey. lekin us ne sab ko thakaa diya. qaum ke paas ghodey kam they. aik sahabi teer lekar oont ki taraf jhaptey. Allah ne usko thehra diya. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke in janwaron mein bhi janglii janwaron ki tarah sarkashi hoti hai. isliye in janwaron mein se bhi agar koi tumhen aajiz kar de to iske sath tum aisa hi mamla kya karo. phir mere dada ne arz kya ke kal dushman ke hamle ka khof hai, hamarey paas chhuriyaan nahi hain (talwaaron se zabah karein to unke kharaab honey ka dar hai jabke jang samney hai) kya ham baans ke khapchii se zabah kar saktey hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, jo cheez bhi khoon baha de aur zabiha par Allah Taala ka naam liya gaya ho, to iske khaney mein koi harj nahi. siwaey daant aur naakhun ke. uski wjah main tumhen bataataa hun. daant to haddi hai aur naakhun habshiyon ki chhuri hai."
"2489","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se mana farmaya tha ke koi shakhs apne sathiyon ki ijazat ke baghair (dastar-khaan par) 2-2 khajoor aik sath mila kar khaaey."
"2490","hamara qiyam Madina mein tha aur ham par qahat ka daur-daurah hua. Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) hamein khajoor khaney ke liye detey they aur Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) guzartey huey ye keh kar jaya kartey they ke 2-2 khajoor aik sath mila kar na khana kyonke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne doosrey sathi ki ijazat ke baghair aisa karne se mana farmaya hai."
"2491","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jo shakhs mushtarak ( saajhey (ke ghulam mein apna hissey aazad kar de aur uske paas sarey ghulam ki qeemat ke muwafiq maal ho to wo pura aazad ho jaeyga agar itna maal na ho to bas jitna hissey uska tha utnaa hi aazad hua. Ayub ne kaha ke ye mujhey malum nahi ke riwayat ka ye aakhiri hissey ''ghulam ka wahi hissey aazad hoga jo usney aazad kya hai'' ye Naafe ka apna qaul hai ya Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki hadis mein dakhil hai."
"2492","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jo shakhs mushtarak ghulam mein se apna hissey aazad kar de to uske liye zaroori hai ke apne maal se ghulam ko poori aazadi dila de. lekin agar uske paas itna maal nahi hai to insaf ke sath ghulam ki qeemat lagai jaey. phir ghulam se kaha jaey ke (apni aazadi ki) koshish mein wo baqi hisse ki qeemat khud kamaa kar ada kar ley. lekin ghulam par uske liye koi dabaaw na daala jaey."
"2493","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya Allah ki hudood par qaaim rehney waley aur is mein ghus janey waley (yani khilaf karne waale) ki misal aisey logon ki si hai jinhoney aik kashtii ke silsiley mein Qura dala. jiske nateeje mein kuchh logon ko kashtii ke uper ka hissa aur kuchh ko nichey kaa. isliye jo log nichey waley they, unhein (dariya se) pani leney ke liye uper walon ke paas se guzarna padtaa. unhon-ne sochaa ke kyon na ham apne hi hisse mein aik suraakh kar lein taake uper walon ko ham koi takleef na dein. ab agar uper waley bhi nichey walon ko man-maanii karne dengey to kashtii waley tamam halaak ho jaeinge aur agar uper waley nichey walon ka hath pakad lein to ye khud bhi bachengey aur saari kashtii bhi bach jaeygi."
"2494","unhon-ne Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se ( sura Nisa mein) us aayat ke barey mein puchha ( وإن خفتم‏ ( se ( ورباع‏ ( ''agar tum ko yatimon mein insaf na karne ka dar ho to jo auratein pasand aaein do-do, teen-teen, chaar-chaar nikah mein laao'' unhon-ne kaha mere bhaanjey ye aayat us yateem ladki ke barey mein hai jo apne wali (muhaafiz rishtedar jaisey chacheraa bhaaii, phoophii-zaad ya maamun-zaad bhaaii) ki parwarish mein ho aur tarkey ke maal mein uski saajhii ho aur wo uski maaldaarii aur khoobsoortii par farefta ho kar us se nikah kar lena chahey lekin pura mehar insaf se jitna usko aur jagah milta wo na de, to usey us se mana kar diya gaya ke aisi yateem ladkiyon se nikah kare. albatta agar unke sath unke wali insaf kar sakein aur unki haisiyat ke hisab se behtar se behtar tarze-amal mehar ke barey mein ikhtiyar karein (to is sura mein nikah karne ki ijazat hai) aur unse ye bhi keh diya gaya ke unke siwa jo bhi aurat unhein pasand ho unse wo nikah kar saktey hain. Urwa-bin-Zubair ne kaha ke Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne batlaayaa, phir logon ne us aayat ke nazil honey ke baad) aisi ladkiyon se nikah ki ijazat ke barey mein) masla puchha to Allah Taala ne ye aayat nazil ki) ويستفتونك في Nisa ( ''aur aap se aurton ke barey mein ye log sawal kartey hain''. aagey farmaya aur tum unse nikah karna chahtey ho. ye jo is aayat mein hai aur jo Quran main tum par padha jata hai us se murad pehli aayat hai yani ''agar tum ko yatimon mein insaf na ho sakney ka dar ho to dusri auratein jo bhalii lagein unse nikah kar lo''. Sayeda Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ye jo Allah ne dusri aayat mein farmaya aur tum unse nikah karna chahtey ho us se ye gharaz hai ke jo yateem ladki tumhari parwarish mein ho aur maal aur jamaal kam rakhti ho us se to tum nafrat kartey ho, isliye jis yateem ladki ke maal aur jamaal main tum ko raghbat ho us se bhi nikah na karo magar is sura mein jab insaf ke sath unka pura mehar ada karo."
"2495","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Shufaa ka haq aisey maalon (zameen, jaaidaad wghaira) mein diya tha jinki taqseem na hui ho. lekin jab uski had bandi ho jaey aur rastey bhi badal diye jayen to phir Shufaa ka koi haq baqi nahi rahega."
"2496","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne har us jaaidaad mein Shufaa ka haq diya tha jiski shurakaa mein abhi taqseem na hui ho. lekin agar had bandi ho jaey aur rastey alag ho jayen to phir Shufaa ka haq baqi nahi rahtaa."
"2497","maine Abul-Minhaal se Sauda sirf naqd ke barey mein puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke maine aur mere aik Sharik ne koi cheez (soney aur chandi ki) kharidi naqd par bhi aur udhaar par bhii. phir hamarey yahan Bara-bin-Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) aaey to ham ne unse uske barey mein poochha. unhon-ne kaha ke maine aur mere Sharik Zaid-bin-Arqam (Raziallahu anhu) ne bhi ye Sauda kiya tha aur ham ne iske mutaalliq Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha tha to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke jo naqd ho wo ley lo aur jo udhaar ho usey chhod do."
"2498","maine Abul-Minhaal se Sauda sirf naqd ke barey mein puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke maine aur mere aik Sharik ne koi cheez (soney aur chandi ki) kharidi naqd par bhi aur udhaar par bhii. phir hamarey yahan Bara-bin-Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) aaey to ham ne unse iske barey mein poochha. unhon-ne kaha ke maine aur mere Sharik Zaid-bin-Arqam (Raziallahu anhu) ne bhi ye Sauda kiya tha aur ham ne iske mutaalliq Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha tha to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya tha ke jo naqd ho wo ley lo aur jo udhaar ho usey chhod do."
"2499","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khaibar ki zameen yahudiyon ko us shart par de di thi ke wo usmein mehnat karein aur boiin jotein . paidawar ka aadha hissey unhein mila karega ."
"2500","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein bakriyan di thin ke qurbani ke liye unko sahaba mein taqseem kar din. phir aik saal ka bakri ka bachcha bach gaya to unhon-ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se iska zikr kya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Aqba se farmaya to uski qurbani kar ley."
"2501","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko paya tha. unki walida Zainab-binte-Humaid (Raziallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aapko lekar hazir huin aur arz kya ke ya Rasulullah! us se bait ley lijiye. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye to abhi bachcha hai. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke sar par hath phera aur unke liye dua ki aur Zohra-bin-Ma'bad se riwayat hai ke unke dada Abdullah-bin Hisham (Raziallahu anhu) unhein apne sath bazar ley jatey. wahan wo ghalla khareedtey. phir Abdullah-bin-Umar aur Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) unse miltey to wo kehtey ke hamein bhi us anaaj mein Sharik kar lo. kyonke aap ke liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne barkat ki dua ki hai. chunanche Abdullah-bin Hisham unhein bhi Sharik kar letey aur kabhi pura aik oont (ghalle ke saath) nafe mein paida kar letey aur usko ghar bhej detey."
"2502","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko paya tha. unki walida Zainab-binte-Humaid (Raziallahu anhu) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aapko lekar hazir huin aur arz kya ke ya Rasulullah! us se bait ley lijiye. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye to abhi bachcha hai. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unke sar par hath phera aur unke liye dua ki aur Zohra-bin-Ma'bad se riwayat hai ke unke dada Abdullah-bin Hisham (Raziallahu anhu) unhein apne sath bazar ley jatey. wahan wo ghalla khareedtey. phir Abdullah-bin-Umar aur Abdullah-bin-Zubair (Raziallahu anhu) unse miltey to wo kehtey ke hamein bhi us anaaj mein Sharik kar lo. kyonke aap ke liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne barkat ki dua ki hai. chunanche Abdullah-bin Hisham unhein bhi Sharik kar letey aur kabhi pura aik oont (ghalle ke saath) nafe mein paida kar letey aur usko ghar bhej detey."
"2503","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jisne kisi saajhey ke ghulam ka apna hissey aazad kar diya to uske liye zaroori hai ke agar ghulam ki insaf ke muwafiq qeemat ke barabar uske paas maal ho to wo Sara ghulam aazad kara de. is tarah doosrey saajhiyon ko unke hissey ki qeemat ada kar di jaey aur us aazad kiye huey ghulam ka peechhaa chhod diya jaey."
"2504","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jisne kisi (saajhey ke) ghulam ka apna hissey aazad kar diya to agar uske paas maal hai to pura ghulam aazad ho jaeyga warna baqi hisson ko aazad karaaney ke liye us se mehnat mazdoorii karaai jaey. lekin is silsiley main is par koi dabaaw na daala jaey."
"2505","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chothi Zil-Hijja ki subah ko Haj ka talbiya kehtey huey jiske sath koi aur cheez (Umra) na milaate huey (Makka mein) dakhil huey. jab ham Makka pahunchey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hukm se ham ne apne Haj ko Umra kar dala. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye bhi farmaya ke (Umra ke arkaan ada karne ke baad Haj ke ehram tak) hamari beeviyan hamarey liye halal rahengii. is par logon mein charcha honey laga. Ata ne bayan kya ke Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke kuchh log kehney lagey kya ham mein se koi Mina is tarah jaey ke mani uske zakar (private part) se tapak rahi ho. Jaabir ne hath se ishara bhi kya. ye baat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tak pahunchi to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khutba dene khadey huey aur farmaya mujhey malum hua hai ke kuchh log is tarah ki baatein kar rahe hain. Allah ki qism mein un logon se zyada nek aur Allah se darney wala hun. agar mujhey wo baat pahley hi malum hoti jo ab malum hui hai to main qurbani ke janwar apne sath na laataa aur agar mere sath qurbani ke janwar na hotey to main bhi ehram khol detaa. is par Suraaqa-bin-Maalik-bin-Ja'sham khadey huey aur kaha ya Rasulullah! kya ye hukm (Haj ke dinon mein Umra) khas hamarey hi liye hai ya hamesha ke liye? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi balke hamesha ke liye hai. Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Ali-bin abi-Talib (Raziallahu anhu) (Yaman se) aaey. ab ata aur Taaus mein se aik to yun kehta hai Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne ehram ke waqt yun kaha thaa. لبيك بما أهل به رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم‏ aur doosra yun kehta hai ke unhon-ne لبيك بحجة رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم kahaa tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein hukm diya ke wo apne ehram par qaaim rahen (jaisaa bhi unhon-ne baandha hai) aur unhein apni qurbani mein Sharik kar liya."
"2506","nabii Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) chothi Zil-Hijja ki subah ko Haj ka talbiya kehtey huey jiske sath koi aur cheez (Umra) na milaate huey (Makka mein) dakhil huey. jab ham Makka pahunchey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hukm se ham ne apne Haj ko Umra kar dala. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ye bhi farmaya ke (Umra ke arkaan ada karne ke baad Haj ke ehram tak) hamari beeviyan hamarey liye halal rahengii. is par logon mein charcha honey laga. Ata ne bayan kya ke Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke kuchh log kehney lagey kya ham mein se koi Mina is tarah jaey ke mani uske zakar (private part) se tapak rahi ho. Jaabir ne hath se ishara bhi kya. ye baat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tak pahunchi to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khutba dene khadey huey aur farmaya mujhey malum hua hai ke kuchh log is tarah ki baatein kar rahe hain. Allah ki qism mein un logon se zyada nek aur Allah se darney wala hun. agar mujhey wo baat pahley hi malum hoti jo ab malum hui hai to main qurbani ke janwar apne sath na laataa aur agar mere sath qurbani ke janwar na hotey to main bhi ehram khol detaa. is par Suraaqa-bin-Maalik-bin-Ja'sham khadey huey aur kaha ya Rasulullah! kya ye hukm (Haj ke dinon mein Umra) khas hamarey hi liye hai ya hamesha ke liye? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi balke hamesha ke liye hai. Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Ali-bin abi-Talib (Raziallahu anhu) (Yaman se) aaey. ab ata aur Taaus mein se aik to yun kehta hai Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne ehram ke waqt yun kaha thaa. لبيك بما أهل به رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم‏ aur doosra yun kehta hai ke unhon-ne لبيك بحجة رسول الله صلى الله عليه وسلم kahaa tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein hukm diya ke wo apne ehram par qaaim rahen (jaisaa bhi unhon-ne baandha hai) aur unhein apni qurbani mein Sharik kar liyaa."
"2507","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath tahaama ke maqam zul-Hulaifa mein they ( ghaneemat mein) hamein bakriyan aur oont miley they. kuchh logon ne jaldi ki aur (jaanwar zabah karke) gosht ko haandiyon mein chadhaa diya. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hukm se gosht ki haandiyon ko ulat diya gaya. phir (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne taqseem mein) das bakriyon ka aik oont ke barabar hissey rakha. aik oont bhag khada hua. qaum ke paas ghodon ki kami thi. aik shakhs ne oont ko teer mar kar rok liya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke un janwaron mein bhi jangi janwaron ki tarah wahshat hoti hai. isliye jab tak unko na pakad sako to tum unke sath hi aisa sulook kya karo. Abaaya ne bayan kya ke mere dada ne arz kya, ya Rasulullah! hamein ummeed hai ya khatrah hai ke kahin kal dushman se mudbhed na ho jaey aur chhuri hamarey sath nahi hai. kya dhaar-daar lakdi se ham zabah kar saktey hain? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, lekin zabah karne mein jaldi karo. jo cheez khoon baha de (usi se kaat daalo) agar is par Allah ka naam liya jaey to usko khaao aur naakhun aur daant se zabah na karo. uski wjah mein batlaataa hon daant to haddi hai aur naakhun habshiyon ki chhuriyaan hain."
"2508","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni zirah jau ke badley girwii rakhi thi. aik din main khud aap ke paas jau ki roti aur baasii charbi lekar hazir hua tha. maine khud Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se suna tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) farma rahe they ke aal Muhammad par koi subah aur koi Sham aisi nahi aai ke aik saa se zyada kuchh aur maujood raha ho, halanke aap ke nau (9) ghar they."
"2509","ham ne Ibrahim Nakhai (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ke yahan qarz mein rahan aur zaamin ka zikr kya to unhon-ne kaha ke ham se Aswad ne bayan kya aur unse Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik Yahudi se ghalla khareedaa aik muqarrara muddat ke qarz par aur apni zirah uske yahan girwii rakhi thi."
"2510","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya Kab-bin-Ashraf (yahoodii, Islam ka pakka dushman) ka kaam kon tamam karega ke usne Allah aur uske rasool ko bahut takleef de rakhi hai. Muhammad-bin-Musallema (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main (ye khidmat anjam doonga). chunanche wo uske paas gaey aur kaha ke aik ya 2 wasq ghalla qarz leney ke iraadey se aaya hun. Kab ne kaha lekin tumhen apni beeviyon ko mere yahan girwii rakhna hoga Muhammad-bin-Musallema aur uske sathiyon ne kaha ke ham apni beeviyon ko tumharey paas kis tarah girwii rakh saktey hain jabke tum sarey Arab mein khoobsurat ho. usne kaha ke phir apni aulad girwii rakh do. unhon-ne kaha ke ham apni aulad kis tarah rahan rakh saktey hain isi par unhein gali di jaya karegi ke aik 2 wasq ghalley ke liye rahan rakh diye gaey they, to hamarey liye badi sharm ki baat hogi. albatta ham apne hathiyar tumharey yahan rahan rakh saktey hain. Sufiyan ne kaha ke lafz ( لأمة ( se murad hathiyar hain. phir Muhammad-bin-Musalema (Raziallahu anhu) us se dobara milney ka wada karke (chaley aaey aur raat ko iske yahan pahunch kar) usey qatl kar diya. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khabar di."
"2511","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya girwii janwar par uska kharch nikalney ke liye sawari ki jaey, doodh wala janwar girwii ho to uska doodh piyaa jaey."
"2512","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, girwii janwar par uske kharch ke badal sawari ki jaey. isi tarah doodh waley janwar ka jab wo girwii ho to kharch ke badal uska doodh piyaa jaey aur jo koi sawari karey ya doodh piey wahi uska kharch uthaaey."
"2513","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kuchh muddat thehra kar aik Yahudi se ghalla khareedaa aur apni zirah uske paas girwii rakhii."
"2514","maine Abdullah-bin-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein (2 aurton ke muqaddime mein) likha to uske jawab mein unhon-ne tahreer farmaya ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne faisla kya tha ke (agar muddaii gawah na pesh kar sakey) to mudduaa alaih se qism li jaeygi."
"2515","jo shakhs jaan-bojh kar us niyat se jhooti qism khaaey ke is tarah doosrey ke maal par apni milkiyat jamaaey to wo Allah Taala se us haal mein milega ke Allah Taala is par ghazabnaak hoga. us irshad ki tasdeeq mein Allah Taala ne (sura aale-Imraan mein) ye aayat nazil farmai ( إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ثمنا قليلا‏ ( ''wo log jo Allah ke ahad aur apni qasmon ke zariey duniya ki thodi poojii khareedtey hain'' aakhir aayat tak unhon-ne tilawat ki. abu-Waaeil ne kaha iske baad asha's-bin-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) hamarey ghar tashrif laey aur puchha ke abu-Abdur-Rehman (abu-Masood (rz)) ne tum se kon si hadis bayan ki hai? unhon-ne kaha ke ham ne uper wali hadis unke samney pesh kar di. is par unhon-ne kaha ke unhon-ne sach bayan kya hai. mera aik (yahoodii) shakhs se kuwein ke mamley mein jhagdaa hua tha. ham apna jhagdaa lekar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum apne gawah lao warna doosrey fareeq se qism li jaeygi. maine arz kya phir ye to qism kha lega aur (jhoot bolney par) usey kuchh parwah na hogi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs jaan-bojh kar kisi ka maal hadap karne ke liye jhooti qism khaaey to Allah Taala se wo us haal mein milega ke wo is par bahut hi zyada ghazabnaak hoga. Allah Taala ne uski tasdeeq mein ye aayat nazil ki. iske baad unhon-ne wahi aayat padhi ( إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ثمنا قليلا‏ ( ''jo log Allah ke ahad aur apni qasmon ke zariey thodi poojii khareedtey hain''. aakhir tak."
"2516","jo shakhs jaan-bojh kar us niyat se jhooti qism khaaey ke is tarah doosrey ke maal par apni milkiyat jamaaey to wo Allah Taala se us haal mein milega ke Allah Taala is par ghazabnaak hoga. us irshad ki tasdeeq mein Allah Taala ne (sura aale-Imraan mein) ye aayat nazil farmai ( إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ثمنا قليلا‏ ( ''wo log jo Allah ke ahad aur apni qasmon ke zariey duniya ki thodi poojii khareedtey hain'' aakhir aayat tak unhon-ne tilawat ki. abu-Waaeil ne kaha iske baad asha's-bin-Qais (Raziallahu anhu) hamarey ghar tashrif laey aur puchha ke abu-Abdur-Rehman (abu-Masood (rz)) ne tum se kon si hadis bayan ki hai? unhon-ne kaha ke ham ne uper wali hadis unke samney pesh kar di. is par unhon-ne kaha ke unhon-ne sach bayan kya hai. mera aik (yahoodii) shakhs se kuwein ke mamley mein jhagdaa hua tha. ham apna jhagdaa lekar Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum apne gawah lao warna doosrey fareeq se qism li jaeygi. maine arz kya phir ye to qism kha lega aur (jhoot bolney par) usey kuchh parwah na hogi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo shakhs jaan-bojh kar kisi ka maal hadap karne ke liye jhooti qism khaaey to Allah Taala se wo us haal mein milega ke wo is par bahut hi zyada ghazabnaak hoga. Allah Taala ne uski tasdeeq mein ye aayat nazil ki. iske baad unhon-ne wahi aayat padhi ( إن الذين يشترون بعهد الله وأيمانهم ثمنا قليلا‏ ( ''jo log Allah ke ahad aur apni qasmon ke zariey thodi poojii khareedtey hain''. aakhir tak."
"2517","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jis shakhs ne bhi kisi musalman ( ghulam ( ko aazad kya to Allah Taala us ghulam ke jism ke har uzu (ang) ki aazadi ke badley us shakhs ke jism ke bhi eik-eik uzu (ang) ko dozakh se aazad karega. Saeed-bin-Marjaana ne bayan kya ke phir main Ali-bin Husain (Zainul-Aabedeen (rh)) ke yahan gaya (aur unse hadis bayan ki) wo apne aik ghulam ki taraf mutwajjeh huey. jiski Abdullaah-bin-Ja'far das hazaar dirham ya aik hazaar Dinar qeemat de rahe they aur aap ne usey aazad kar diya."
"2518","maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha ke kon sa amal afzal hai, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah par eman lana aur uski raah mein jihad karna. maine puchha aur kis tarah ka ghulam aazad karna afzal hai? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, jo sabse zyada qeemtii ho aur Malik ki nazar mein jo bahut zyada pasandida ho. maine arz kya ke agar mujh se ye na ho sakaa? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, ke phir kisi musalman kaareegar ki madad kar ya kisi be-hunar ki. unhon-ne kaha ke agar main ye bhi na kar sakaa? is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke phir logon ko apne shar se mehfooz kar de ke ye bhi aik sadqa hai jisey tum khud apne uper karogey."
"2519","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne suraj girahan ke waqt ghulam aazad karne ka hukm farmaya hai. Musa ke sath us hadis ko Ali-bin madeenii ne bhi Abdul-Azeez darawardi se riwayat kya hai. unhon-ne Hisham se."
"2520","hamein suraj girahan ke waqt ghulam aazad karne ka hukm diya jata tha."
"2521","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya 2 saajhiyon ke darmyan saajhey ke ghulam ko agar kisi aik saajhii ne aazad kya, to agar aazad karne wala maaldaar hai to baqi hisson ki qeemat ka andaza kya jaeyga phir (usi ki taraf se) poorey ghulam ko aazad kar diya jaeyga"
"2522","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jisne kisi mushtarak ghulam main apne hissey ko aazad kar diya aur uske paas itna maal hai ke ghulam ki poori qeemat ada ho sakey to uski qeemat insaf ke sath lagai jaeygi aur baqi saajhiyon ko unke hissey ki qeemat (usi ke maal se) de kar ghulam ko usi ki taraf se aazad kar diya jaeyga warna ghulam ka jo hissey aazad ho chuka wo ho chukaa. baqi hisson ki aazadi ke liye ghulam ko khud koshish karke qeemat ada karni hogi."
"2523","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jisne kisi mushtarak ghulam ke apne hissey ko aazad kya aur uske paas ghulam ki poori qeemat ada karne ke liye maal bhi hai to pura ghulam usey aazad karaanaa lazim hai lekin agar uske paas itna maal na ho jis se poorey ghulam ki sahi qeemat ada ki ja sakey. to phir ghulam ka jo hissey aazad ho gaya wahi aazad hua. ham se Musaddad ne bayan kya, unse Bishr ne bayan kya aur unse Ubaidullah ne ikhtisar ke saath."
"2524","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya jisne kisi ( saajhey ( ghulam ka apna hissey aazad kar diya. ya (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne) ye alfaz farmaaey (شركا له في عبد) ( shak rawi hadis Ayub sakhtiyan ko hua) aur uske paas itna maal bhi tha jis se poorey ghulam ki munasib qeemat ada ki ja sakti thi to wo ghulam poori tarah aazad samjha jaeyga (baqi hisson ki qeemat usko deeni hogi) Naafe ne bayan kya warna uska jo hissey aazad ho gaya bas wo aazad ho gaya. Ayub ne kaha ke mujhey malum nahi ye (aakhirii tukdaa) khud Naafe ne apni taraf se kaha tha ya ye bhi hadis mein shamil hai."
"2525","Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ghulam ya baandi ke barey mein ye fatwa diya kartey they ke agar wo kai saajhiyon ke darmyan mushtarak ho aur aik Sharik apna hissey aazad kar de to ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) farmatey they ke us shakhs par poorey ghulam ke aazad karaaney ki zimme-dari hogi lekin ye is sura mein jab shakhs mazkoor ke paas itna maal ho jis se poorey ghulam ki qeemat ada ki ja sakey. ghulam ki munasib qeemat laga kar doosrey saajhiyon ko unke hisson ke mutabiq adaaeygi kar di jaeygi aur ghulam ko aazad kar diya jaeyga ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) ye fatwa Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se naql kartey they aur Lais-bin-abii-Zi'ib, ibn-Is'haaq, Juweriya, Yahya-bin-Saeed aur Ismaaeel-bin-Umayya bhi Naafe se us hadis ko riwayat kartey hain, wo Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se aur wo Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se mukhtasar taur par."
"2526","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jisne kisi ghulam ka aik hissey aazad kya.''"
"2527","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jisne kisi saajhey ke ghulam ka apna hissey aazad kya to uski poori aazadi usi ke zimma hai. basharte ke uske paas maal ho. warna ghulam ki qeemat lagai jaeygi aur (us se apne Baqiiya hisson ki qeemat ada karne ki) koshish ke liye kaha jaeyga lekin is par koi sakhti na ki jaaeygii.'' Saeed ke sath us hadis ko hujjaaj-bin-Hujjaaj, Aban aur Moosaa-bin-khalaf ne bhi Qatada se riwayat kya. Shoba ne isey mukhtasar kar diya hai."
"2528","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Allah taala ne meri ummat ke dilon mein paida hone-waale waswason ko maaf kar diya hai jab tak wo unhein amal ya zaban par na laaein.''"
"2529","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''aa'maal ka madaar niyat par hai aur har shakhs ko uski niyat ke mutabiq phal milta hai. to jiski hijrat Allah aur uske rasool ke liye ho, wo Allah aur uske rasool ke liye samjhii jaeygi aur jiski hijrat duniya ke liye hogi ya kisi aurat se shadi karne ke liye to ye hijrat mahz usi ke liye hogi jiski niyat se us ne hijrat ki hai.''"
"2530","jab wo Islam qabool karne ke iraadey se (Madina ke liye) nikley to unke sath unka ghulam bhi tha. ( rastey mein) wo donon aik doosrey se bichhad gaey. phir jab Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) (Madina pahunchne ke baad) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein baithey huey they, to unka ghulam bhi achcha aa gaya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, Abu-Hurera ! ye lo tumhara ghulam bhi aa gaya. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha, ya Rasulullah! main aapko gawah banata hun ke ye ghulam ab aazad hai. rawi ne kaha ke Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne Madina pahunch kar ye sher kahey they. hai pyari bhale hi kathin hai aur lambi meri raat, par dilai us ne daarul-kufr se mujh ko najaat."
"2531","jab main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua tha to aatey huey rastey mein ye sher kaha tha : hai pyari bhale hi kathin hai aur lambi meri raat, par dilai us ne daarul-kufr se mujh ko najaat. unhon-ne bayan kya ke rastey mein mera ghulam mujh se bichhad gaya tha. phir jab main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua to Islam par qaaim rehney ke liye maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bait kar li. mein abhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas betha hi hua tha ke wo ghulam dikhai diya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, abu-Huraira! ye dekh tera ghulam bhi aa gaya. maine kaha, ya Rasulullah! wo Allah ke liye aazad hai. phir maine usey aazad kar diya. imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) farmatey hain ke abu-Kuraib ne (apni riwayat mein) abu-Usama se ye lafz nahi riwayat kya ke wo aazad hai."
"2566","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''aey musalman aurto! hargiz koi padausan apni dusri padausan ke liye (ma'moolii hadiya ko bhi) haqeer na samjhey, chahe bakri ke khur ka hi kyon na ho.''"
"2567","aap ne Urwa se kaha, mere bhaanjey! Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke ahade-mubaarak mein (ye haal tha ke) ham aik chaand dekhtey, phir doosra dekhtey, phir teesra dekhtey, isi tarah 2-2 mahiney guzar jatey aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke gharon mein (khaanaa pakaaney ke liye) aag na jaltii thi. maine poochha. khala ammaan! phir aap log zinda kis tarah rehti thiin? aap ne farmaya ke sirf 2 kali chizon khajoor aur pani par. albatta Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke chand Ansari padosi they. jinke paas doodh dene wali bakriyan thin aur wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan bhi unka doodh tohfe ke taur par pahuncha jaya kartey they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) usey hamein bhi pilaa diya kartey they."
"2568","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''agar mujhey bazu aur paaey (ke gosht ( par bhi dawat di jaey to main qabool kar loonga aur mujhey bazu ya paaey (ke gosht) ka tohfa bheja jaey to usey bhi qabool kar loonga.''"
"2569","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik muhaajira aurat ke paas ( apna aadmi ( bhejaa. unka aik ghulam badhii tha. unse Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke apne ghulam se hamarey liye lakdiyon ka aik member banaaney ke liye kahin . chunanche unhon-ne apne ghulam se kaha, wo Ghaaba se ja kar jhaau kaat laya aur usi ka aik member bana diya. jab wo member bana chukey to us aurat ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein kelha bheja ke member bin kar taiyaar hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kahlwaayaa ke usey mere paas bhijwa dein. jab log usey laey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khud usey uthaya aur jahan tum ab dekh rahe ho. wahin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey rakha."
"2570","Makka ke rastey mein aik jagah main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke chand sathiyon ke sath betha hua tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ham se aagey qiyam farma they. (hijjatul-wadaa ke mauqe par) aur log to ehram baandhey huey they lekin mera ehram nahi tha. mere sathiyon ne aik gorkhar dekha. main us waqt apni jootii gaanthney mein mashghool tha. un logon ne mujh ko kuchh khabar nahi di. lekin unki khahish yahi thi ke kisi tarah mein gorkhar ko dekh loon. chunanche maine jo nazar uthai to gorkhar dikhai diya. main fauran ghodey ke paas gaya aur is par zeen kas kar Sawar ho gaya, magar ittifaq se ( jaldi mein) kodaa aur neza donon bhool gaya. isliye maine apne sathiyon se kaha ke wo mujhey kodaa aur neza utha dein. unhon-ne kaha hargiz nahi qism Allah ki, ham tumharey (shikaar mein) kisi qism ki madad nahi kar saktey. (kyonke ham sab log haalate-ehraam mein hain) mujhey is par ghussa aaya aur maine khud hi utar kar donon cheezein ley liin. phir Sawar ho kar gorkhar par hamla kya aur usko shikar kar laya. wo mar bhi chuka tha. ab logon ne kaha ke usey khana chahiye lekin phir ehram ki haalat mein usey khaney (ke jawaaz) par shuba hua. (lekin kuchh logon ne shuba nahi kya aur gosht khaya ( phir ham aagey badhey aur maine us gorkhar ka aik bazu chipa rakha tha. jab ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas pahunchey to uske mutaalliq aap se sawal kya, (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ehram ki haalat mein rahnewaalon ke liye shikar ke gosht khaney ka fatwa diyaa) aur malum farmaya ke usmein se kuchh bacha hua gosht tumharey paas maujood bhi hai? maine kaha ke ji haan ! aur wahi bazu Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein pesh kya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey khaya, yahan tak ke wo khatm ho gaya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) bhi us waqt ehram se they ( abu-Hazim ne kaha ke) mujh se yahi hadis Zaid-bin-Aslam ne bayan ki, unse Ata-bin-Yasar ne aur unse abu-Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) ne."
"2571","(eik martaba) Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamarey usi ghar mein tashrif laey aur pani talab farmaya, hamarey paas aik bakri thi, usey ham ne dohaa. phir maine usi kuwein ka pani mila kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein (lassii bana kar) pesh kya, Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki baain taraf baithey huey they aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) samney they aur aik dehati Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki daain taraf tha. jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) pi kar farigh huey to (piyaaley mein kuchh doodh bach gaya tha us liye) umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya ke ye Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) hain. lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey dehati ko ata farmaya, (kyonke wo daain taraf tha) phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, daain taraf baithney waale, daain taraf baithney waley hi haq rakhtey hain. to khabardaar daain taraf hi se shuru kiya karo. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke yahi sunnat hai, yahi sunnat hai, teen martaba (aap ne is baat ko dohraayaa)."
"2572","marruz-zohraan naam ke jagah mein ham ne aik khargosh ka peechhaa kya. log (uske peechhey) daudey aur usey thakaa diya aur maine qareeb pahunch kar usey pakad liya. phir abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan laya. unhon-ne usey zabah kya aur uske peechhey ka ya donon raanon ka gosht Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein bhejaa. (Shoba ne baad mein yaqin ke saath) kaha ke donon raanein unhon-ne bheji thin, usmein koi shak nahi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey qabool farmaya tha maine puchha aur is mein se Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne kuchh tanaawul bhi farmaayaa? unhon-ne bayan kya ke haan! kuchh khaya tha. iske baad phir unhon-ne kaha ke aap ne wo hadiya qabool farma liya tha."
"2573","unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein gorkhar ka tohfa pesh kya tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt maqaame-Abwaa ya maqaame-Wadaan mein they (raawii ko shuba hai) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unka tohfa wapas kar diya. phir unke chehrey par (ranj ke aasaar) dekh kar farmaya ke maine ye tohfa sirf isliye wapas kya hai ke ham ehram baandhey huey hain."
"2574","log ( Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein) tohfey bhejney ke liye Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki baari ka intizar kya kartey they. apne hadiyon se, ya us khas din ke intizar se ( rawi ko shak hai) log Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khushi hasil karna chahtey they."
"2575","unki khala umme-Hufaid (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein paneer , ghi aur goh ( saahina (ke tohfey bhejey. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne paneer aur ghi mein se to khaya lekin goh pasand na honey ki wjah se chhod di. Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke (usi ( dastar-khuwaan par goh ( saahina ( ko bhi khaya gaya aur agar wo haram hoti to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke dastar-khuwaan par kyon khaaii jati."
"2576","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein jab koi khaney ki cheez laai jati to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) malum farmatey ye tohfa hai ya sadqa ? agar kaha jata ke sadqe hai to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) apne ashaab se farmatey ke khaao , Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khud na khaatey aur agar kaha jata ke tohfa hai to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khud bhi hath badhaatey aur sahaba ke sath usey khaatey ."
"2577","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aik martaba gosht pesh kya gaya aur ye bataya gaya ke ye Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ko kisi ne bataur sadqe ke diya hai. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''unke liye ye sadqa hai aur hamarey liye (jab unke yahan se pahuncha to) hadiya hai.''"
"2578","maine ye hadis Abdur-Rehman se suni thi aur unhon-ne Qasim se riwayat ki, unhon-ne Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) se ke unhon-ne Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ko) aazad karne ke liye) khareednaa chaha. lekin unke maalikon ne 'walaa' ki shart apne liye lagaaii. jab iska zikr Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se hua to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaayaa: to unhein khareed kar aazad kar de, 'walaa' to usi ke sath qaaim hoti hai jo aazad kare. aur Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan ( sadqa ka ( gosht aaya tha to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, achchha ye wahi hai jo Barira ko sadqe mein mila hai. ye unke liye to sadqa hai lekin hamarey liye ( chunkey unke ghar se bataur hadiya mila hai) hadiya hai aur) aazadi ke baad Barira ko) ikhtiyar diya gaya tha (ke agar chaahein to apne nikah ko fasakh kar sakti hain) Abdur-Rehman ne puchha Barira (Raziallahu anhu) ke khawind (Mughees (Raziallahu anhu)) ghulam they ya aazad ? Shoba ne bayan kya ke maine Abdur-Rehman se unke khawind ke mutaalliq puchha to unhon-ne kaha ke mujhey malum nahi wo ghulam they ya aazaad."
"2579","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke yahan tashrif le gaey aur malum farmaya, kya koi cheez ( khaney ki) tumharey paas hai? unhon-ne kaha ke umme-Atiya (Raziallahu anhu) ke yahan jo aap ne sadqa ki bakri bheji thi, uska gosht unhon-ne bheja hai. iske siwa aur kuchh nahi hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo apni jagah pahunch chukii."
"2580","log tohfey bhejney ke liye meri baari ka intizar kya kartey they. aur Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha meri saukanein (nabi ki beeviyan rz) jama thin us waqt unhon-ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ( bataur shikayat logon ki us ravish ka ( zikr kya. to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein koi jawab nahi diya."
"2581","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beeviyon 2 giroh mein thin. aik main Aaisha, Hafsa , Safiya aur Sauda (Raziallahu anha) aur dusri mein Umme-Salma aur Baqiiya tamam paak beeviyan (Raziallahu anhu) thin. musalmanon ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke sath mohabbat ka ilm tha isliye jab kisi ke paas koi tohfa hota aur wo usey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein pesh karna chahta to intizar karta. jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ke ghar ki baari hoti to tohfa dene waley sahib apna tohfa Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein bhejtey. is par Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ki jamat ki paak beeviyon ne aapas mein mashwara kya aur Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) se kaha ke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se baat karein taake Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) logon se farma dein ke jisey aap ke yahan tohfa bhejna ho wo jahan bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hon wahin bheja kare. chunanche un beeviyon ke mashwara ke mutabiq unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unhein koi jawab nahi diya. phir un khawaateen ne puchha to unhon-ne bata diya ke mujhey Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne koi jawab nahi diya. paak beeviyon ne kaha ke phir aik martaba kaho. unhon-ne bayan kya, phir jab aap ki baari aai to dobara unhon-ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se arz kya. us martaba bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey iska koi jawab hi nahi diya. beeviyon ne us martaba unse kaha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko us mas'ale par bulwao to sahii. jab unki baari aai to unhon-ne phir kaha, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us martaba farmaya, Aaisha ke barey mein mujhey takleef na do. Aaisha ke siwa apni beeviyon mein se kisi ke kapdey mein bhi mujh par wahi nazil nahi hoti hai. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke us irshad par unhon-ne arz kya, aapko takleef pahunchaney ki wjah se main Allah ke huzoor mein tauba karti hun. phir un paak beeviyon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki sahibzadi Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ko bulaya aur unke zariey Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein ye kahlwaayaa ke aap ki beeviyan Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ki beti ke barey mein Allah ke liye aap se insaf chahti hain. chunanche unhon-ne bhi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se baat cheet ki. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, meri beti ! kya tum wo pasand nahi karti jo main pasand karun? unhon-ne jawab diya ke kyon nahi. iske baad wo wapas aa gain aur beeviyon ko itlaa di. unhon-ne unse phir dobara khidmat nabwi mein janey ke liye kaha, lekin aap ne dobara janey se inkar kya to unhon-ne Zenab binte-Jahash (Raziallahu anha) ko bhejaa. wo khidmat nabwi mein hazir huin to unhon-ne sakht guftgu ki aur kaha ke aap ki beeviyan abu-Qahaafa ki beti ke barey mein aap se Allah ke liye insaf maangtii hain aur unki awaz unchi ho gaee. Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) wahin baithi hui thin. unhon-ne (unke munh par) unhein bhi bura bhala kaha, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki taraf dekhney lagey ke wo kuchh boltii hain ya nahi. rawi ne bayan kya ke Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) bhi bol padiin aur Zenab (Raziallahu anha) ki baton ka jawab dene lagiin aur aakhir unhein khamosh kar diya. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki taraf dekh kar farmaya ke ye Abu-Bakar ki beti hai. imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ne kaha ke aakhir kalam Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ke waqia se mutaalliq Hisham-bin-Urwa ne aik aur shakhs se bayan kya hai. unhon-ne Zohri se riwayat ki aur unhon-ne Muhammad-bin Abdur-Rehman se aur Abu-Marwaan ne bayan kya ke Hisham se aur unhon-ne Urwa se ke log tohfey bhejney ke liye Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki baari ka intizar kya kartey they aur Hisham ki aik riwayat Quraish ke aik sahib aur aik doosrey sahib se jo ghulaamon mein se they, bhi hai. wo Zohri se naql kartey hain aur wo Muhammad-bin Abdur-Rehman bin Haris-bin-Hisham se ke Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne kaha jab Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ne (andar aaney ki) ijazat chahi to main us waqt Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hi ki khidmat mein maujood thi."
"2582","mujh se Samama bin-Abdullah ne bayan kya, azra ne kaha ke main Samama bin-Abdullah ki khidmat mein hazir hua to unhon-ne mujhey khushbu inayat farmai aur bayan kya ke Anas (Raziallahu anhu) khushbu ko wapas nahi kartey they. Samama ne kaha ke Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ka guman tha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khushbu ko wapas nahi farmaya kartey they."
"2583","jab qabila Hawazin ka wafad Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne logon ko khitab farmaya aur Allah ki shaan ke mutabiq sana ke baad aap ne farmaya : ammaa ba'd! ye tumharey bhai tauba karke hamarey paas aaey hain aur main yahi behtar samajhta hun ke unke qaidi unhein wapas kar diye jaaein. ab jo shakhs apni khushi se ( qaidiyon ko) wapas karna chahey wo wapas kar de aur jo ye chahey ke unhein unka hissey miley (to wo bhi wapas kar de) aur hamein Allah Taala (iske baad) sabse pehli jo ghaneemat dega, usmein se ham usey muaawaza de dengey. logon ne kaha ham apni khushi se (unke qaidi wapas karke (aap ka irshad taslim kartey hain."
"2585","ham se Musaddad ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Esa-bin-Yonus ne bayan kya, kaha ham se Hisham ne, unse unke walid ne aur unse Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hadiyaa qabool farma liya kartey they, lekin uska badla bhi de diya kartey they; us hadis ko Wakee or Muhaazir ne bhi riwayat kiya hai, magar unhoney isko Hisham se, unhoney apne bap se unhoney Hazrat Aaisha se ke alfaz nahi kahey."
"2586","unke walid unhein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein laey aur arz kya ke maine apne us betey ko aik ghulam bataur hiba diya hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya, kya aisa hi ghulam apne doosrey ladkon ko bhi diya hai? unhon-ne kaha nahi, to aap ne farmaya ke phir ( unse bhi) wapas ley ley."
"2587","wo member par bayan kar rahe they ke mere bap ne mujhey aik Atiya diya, to Umra-binte-Rawaaha (Raziallahu anhu) (Naumaan ki waalida) ne kaha ke jab tak aap Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko is par gawah na banaaein main razi nahi ho saktii. chunanche (haazire-khidmat ho kar) unhon-ne arz kya ke Umra-binteRawaaha se apne betey ko maine aik Atiya diya to unhon-ne kaha ke pahley main aapko is par gawah bana loon, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ke usi jaisa Atiya tum ne apni tamam aulad ko diya hai? unhon-ne jawab diya ke nahi, is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah se daro aur apni aulad ke darmyan insaf ko qaaim rakho. chunanche wo wapas huey aur hadiya wapas ley liya."
"2588","Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne bayan kya, jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki bimari badhii aur takleef shadeed ho gaee to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apni beeviyon se mere ghar mein bimari ke din guzarney ki ijazat chahi aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko beeviyon ne ijazat de di to aap is tarah tashrif laey ke donon qadam zameen par ragad kha rahe they. aap us waqt Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) aur aik aur sahib ke darmyan they. Ubaidullah ne bayan kya ke phir maine Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki us hadis ka zikr Ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) se kya. to unhon-ne mujh se poochha, Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ne jinka naam nahi liya, jantey ho wo kon they? maine kaha ke nahi? aap ne farmaya ke wo Ali-bin abi-Talib (Raziallahu anhu) they."
"2589","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' apna hiba wapas leney wala us kuttey ki tarah hai jo qai karke phir chaat jata hai.''"
"2590","maine arz kya ya Rasulullah ! mere paas sirf wahi maal hai jo ( mere shauhar ( Zuber ne mere paas rakha hua hai, to kya main usmein se sadqa kar sakti hon ? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' sadqa karo, jod ke na rakho, kahin tum se bhii. ( Allah ki taraf se na ( rok liya jaaey.''"
"2591","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''kharch kya kar, gunah na kar, taake tumhen bhi gin ke na miley aur jod ke na rakho, taake tum se bhi Allah Taala (apni ne'maton ko) na chipa ley.'"
"2592","unhon-ne aik londi Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se ijazat liye baghair aazad kar di. phir jis din Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki baari aap ke ghar aaney ki thi, unhon-ne khidmat nabwi mein arz kya, ya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ! aapko malum bhi hua, maine aik londi aazad kar di hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, achchha tum ne aazad kar diya? unhon-ne arz kya ke haan! farmaya ke agar iske bajaey tum ne apne nanihaal walon ko di hoti to tumhen us se bhi zyada sawab miltaa. us hadis ko Bukair-bin-Muzir ne Amr-bin-Haris se, unhon-ne Bukair se, unhon-ne Kureb se riwayat kya ke Memuna (Raziallahu anha) ne apni londi aazad kar di. akheer tak."
"2593","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab safar ka irada kartey to apni beeviyon ke liye Qura andazi kartey aur jinka Qura nikal aata unhiin ko apne sath ley jatey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka ye bhi tariqa tha ke apni tamam beeviyon ke liye eik-eik din aur raat ki baari muqarrar kar di thi, albatta ( aakhir mein) Sauda-binte-Zama (Raziallahu anhu) ne apni baari Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ko de di thi, us se unka maqsad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki raza hasil karni thi."
"2594","(bayaan kya ke) Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki paak bevi Memuna (Raziallahu anha) ne apni aik londi aazad ki to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ''agar wo tumharey nanihaal walon ko di jati to tumhen zyada sawab miltaa.''"
"2595","maine arz kya, ya Rasulullah ! meri 2 padosi hain, to mujhey kis ke ghar hadiya bhejna chahiye ? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' jiska darwaza tum se qareeb ho.''"
"2596","unhon-ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aik gorkhar hadiya kya tha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt maqam Abwaa ya maqam Wadaan mein they aur ehram ki haalat mein they. aap ne wo gorkhar wapas kar diya. Sa'b (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke iske baad jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mere chehrey par) narazagi ka asar ( hadiya ki waapsii ki wjah se dekha, to farmaya '' hadiya wapas karna munasib to na tha lekin baat ye hai ke ham ehram baandhey huey hain.''"
"2597","qabila Azd ke aik sahabi ko jinhein ibne- Utbia kehtey they, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sadqa wsool karne ke liye aamil banaya. phir jab wo wapas aaey to kaha ke ye tum logon ka hai (yani baitul-maal ka (aur ye mujhey hadiya mein mila hai. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke wo apne walid ya apni walida ke ghar mein kyon na betha raha. dekhta wahan bhi unhein hadiya milta hai ya nahi. us zaat ki qism ! jiske hath mein meri jaan hai. us (maal zakaat) mein se agar koi shakhs kuchh bhi) naajaaiz ( le-lega to qiyamat ke din usey wo apni gardan par uthaey huey aayega. agar oont hai to wo apni awaz nikaaltaa hua aayega, gaaey hai to wo apni aur agar bakri hai to wo apni awaz nikaaltii hogi. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne apne hath uthaey yahan tak ke ham ne Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki baghl ki safedi bhi dekh li (aur farmaya) aey Allah ! kya maine tera hukm pahuncha diya. aey Allah ! kya maine tera hukm pahuncha diya. teen martaba (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne yahi farmaya ( ."
"2598","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se wada farmaya, agar Bahrain ka maal (jiziye ka ( aaya to main tumhen itnaa-itnaa teen lap maal doonga. lekin Bahrain se maal aaney se pahley hi Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) wafat farma gaey aur Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) ne aik manaadii se ye elaan karne ke liye kaha ke jis se Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka koi wada ho ya Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par iska koi qarz ho to wo hamarey paas aaey. chunanche main Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan gaya aur kaha ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se wada kya tha. to unhon-ne teen lap bhar kar mujhey diye."
"2599","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne chand qubaaein taqseem kiin aur Makhrima (Raziallahu anhu) ko usmein se aik bhi nahi di. unhon-ne (mujh se) kaha, betey chalo, Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein chalein. main unke sath chalaa. phir unhon-ne kaha ke andar jao aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se arz karo ke main aap ka muntazir khada hua hon, chunanche main andar gaya aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bula laya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) us waqt unhein qubaaon mein se aik Quba pahney huey they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke maine ye tumharey liye chipa rakhi thi, lo ab ye tumhari hai. Miswar ne bayan kya ke (mere waalid) Makhrima (Raziallahu anhu) ne Quba ki taraf dekha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Makhrima ! khush ho ya nahin?''"
"2600","aik dehati Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aaya aur kehney laga ke main to halaak ho gaya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ''kya baat huii? '' arz kya ke Ramazan mein maine apni biwi se ham-bistarii kar li hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya '' tumharey paas koi ghulam hai? ''kaha ke nahi. phir malum farmaya ''kya 2 mahiney pai-dar-pai rozey rakh saktey ho? ''kaha ke nahi. phir malum farmaya ''kya sath miskinon ko khana de saktey ho? '' is par bhi jawab tha ke nahi. bayan kya ke itney mein aik Ansari arq laey. ( arq khajoor ke patton ka bana hua aik tokraa hota tha jis mein khajoor rakhi jati thi) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se farmaya '' usey ley ja aur sadqa kar de'' unhon-ne arz kya, ya Rasulullah! kya apne se zyada zarurat mand par sadqa kar dun? aur us zaat ki qasam! jisne aapko haq ke sath bheja hai ke sarey Madiney mein ham se zyada mohtaaj aur koi gharaana nahi hoga. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''phir jaa, apne hi ghar walon ko khilaa de.''"
"2601","Uhud ki ladai mein unke bap Shahid ho gaey (aur qarz chhod gaey) qarz-khaahon ne taqazey mein badi shiddat ki, to main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se is silsiley mein guftgu ki, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya ke wo mere baagh ki khajoor ley lein (jo bhi hon) aur mere walid ko (jo baqi reh jaey wo qarz) maaf kar dein. lekin unhon-ne inkar kya. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mera baagh unhein nahi diya aur na unke liye phal tudwaaey. balke farmaya ke kal subah main tumharey yahan aaunga . subah ke waqt Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tashrif laey aur khajoor ke darakhton mein tahaltey rahe aur barkat ki dua farmatey rahe phir maine phal tod kar qarz-khaahon ke sarey qarz ada kar diye aur mere paas khajoor bach bhi gaee. iske baad main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) baithey huey they. maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko waaqie ki itlaa di. umr (Raziallahu anhu) bhi wahin baithey huey they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya, Umar! sun rahe ho? umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya, hamein to pahley se malum hai ke aap Allah ke sachey rasool hain. qism Allah ki! ismein kisi shak w shubeh ki gunjaaish hi nahi ke aap Allah ke sachey rasool hain."
"2602","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein peeney ko kuchh laayaa, (doodh ya paanii) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey nosh farmaya, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki daain taraf aik bachcha betha tha aur badey boodhey log baain taraf baithey huey they, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us bachchey se farmaya ke agar to ijazat de (to bacha hua paanii) main un badey logon ko de dun? lekin us ne kaha, ya Rasulullah ! aap ke joothe mein se milney waley kisi hisse ka main eisaar nahi kar sakta. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne piyala jhatkey ke sath usi ki taraf badha diya."
"2603","main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein (safar se lot kar) masjid mein hazir hua to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ( mere oont ki qeemat ( ada ki aur kuchh zyada bhi diya."
"2604","maine Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko safar mein aik oont bechaa tha. jab ham Madina pahunchey to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke masjid mein ja kar do rakaat Namaz padh, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wazan kya. Shoba ne bayan kya, mera khayal hai ke (Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha) mere liye wazan kya (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke hukm se Bilal (Raziallahu anhu) ne) aur (is paldey ko jis mein sikka tha) jhukaa diya. (taake mujhey zyada miley) usmein se kuchh thoda sa mere paas jab se mehfooz tha. lekin Sham (Syria) waley (umwii lashakr) yaume-harra ke mauqe par mujh se chheen kar ley gaey."
"2605","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein kuchh peeney ko laya gaya. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki daain taraf aik bachcha tha aur qaum ke badey log baain taraf they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bachchey se farmaya ke kya tumhari taraf se uski ijazat hai ke main bacha hua pani un buzurgon ko de dun? to us bachchey ne kaha ke nahi qism Allah ki! main aap se milney waley apne hisse ka hargiz eisaar nahi kar sakta. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mashroob unki taraf jhatkey ke sath badha diya."
"2606","aik shakhs ka Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par qarz tha (us ne sakhti ke sath taqaza kya) to sahaba uski taraf badhey. lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya usey chhod do, haq waley ko kuchh na kuchh kehney ki gunjaaish hoti hi hai. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke uske liye aik oont usi ke oont ki Umr ka khareed kar usey de do. sahaba ne arz kya ke us se achi Umr ka hi oont mil raha hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usi ko khareed kar de do ke tum mein sabse achchha aadmi wo hai jo qarz ke ada karne mein sabse achchha ho."
"2607","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein jab Hawazin ka wafad musalman ho kar hazir hua aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se darkhaast ki ke unke amwaal aur qaidi unhein wapas kar diye jayen to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unse farmaya mere sath jitni badi jamat hai usey bhi tum dekh rahe ho aur sabse zyada sachchii baat hi mujhey sabse zyada pasand hai isliye tum log in 2 chizon mein se aik hi ley saktey ho, ya apne qaidi ley lo ya apna maal . maine tumhara pahley hi intizar kya tha aur Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Taaif se waapsii par taqriban das din tak ( maqam Jaarana mein) un logon ka intizar farmatey rahe. phir jab un logon ke samney ye baat poori tarah waazeh ho gaee ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) unki sirf aik hi cheez wapas farma saktey hain to unhon-ne kaha ke ham apne qaidiyon hi ko (waapas lenaa) pasand kartey hain. phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne khadey ho kar musalmanon ko khitab kya, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Allah ki uski shaan ke mutabiq tareef bayan ki aur farmaya, ammaa ba'd! ye tumharey bhai hamarey paas ab tauba karke aaey hain. mera khayal ye hai ke unhein unke qaidi wapas kar dun. isliye jo sahib apni khushi se wapas karna chaahein wo aisa kar lein aur jo log ye chahtey hon ke apne hissey ko na chhodein balke ham unhein iske badley mein sabse pehli ghaneemat ke maal mein se muaawaza dein, to wo bhi (apne maujooda qaidiyon ko) wapas kar dein. sab sahaba ne is par kaha, ya Rasulullah ! ham apni khushi se unhein wapas kartey hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya lekin waazeh taur par us waqt ye malum na ho saka ke kon apni khushi se dene ke liye taiyaar hai aur kon nahi. isliye sab log (apne khemon mein) wapas jayen aur tumharey zimmedaar log tumhara mamla la kar pesh karein. chunanche sab log wapas ho gaey aur numaaindon ne unse guftgu ki aur wapas ho kar Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko bataya ke tamam logon ne khushi se ijazat de di hai. qabila Hawazin ke qaidiyon ke mutaalliq hamein yahi baat malum hui hai. abu-Adbullah (Imam Bukhari (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ( ne kaha ye Zohri (Rahmatullahi-alaih) ka aakhiri qaul tha. yani ye ke qabila Hawazin ke qaidiyon ke mutaalliq hamein yahi baat malum hui hai."
"2609","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik oont bataur qarz liya, qarz-khaah taqaza karne aaya (aur naazebaa guftgu ki) to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya '' haq waley ko kehney ka haq hota hai.'' phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se achi Umr ka oont usey dila diya aur farmaya ''tum mein afzal wo hai jo ada karne mein sabse behtar ho.''"
"2610","wo safar main Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath they aur umr (Raziallahu anhu) ke aik sarkash oont par Sawar they. wo oont Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se bhi aagey badh jaya karta tha. isliye unke walid ( umr (Raziallahu anhu)) ko tanbeeh karni padtii thi ke aey Abdullah ! Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se aagey kisi ko na hona chahiye phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ! ke umr ! usey mujhey bech de. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne arz kya ye to aap hi ka hai. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey khareed liya. phir farmaya, Abdullah ye ab tera hai. jis tarah to chahey istemal kar."
"2611","ham Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath aik safar mein they aur main aik sarkash oont par Sawar tha. Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne umr (Raziallahu anhu) se farmaya ke ye oont mujhey bech de chunanche Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usey khareed liya aur phir farmaya Abdullaah! to ye oont ley ja ( maine ye tujh ko bakhsh diyaa) ."
"2612","umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne dekha ke masjid ke darwazey par aik reshamii hulla (bik raha) hai. aap ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se arz kya, ke kya achchha hota agar aap usey khareed letey aur Juma ke din aur wufood ki mulaqat ke mauqe par usey pahan liya kartey. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne iska jawab ye diya ke isey wahi log pahntey hain jinka aakhirat mein koi hissey nahi hoga. kuchh dinon baad Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke yahan bahut se ( reshamii ( hulley aaey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne aik hulla unmein se umr (Raziallahu anhu) ko bhi inayat farmaya, umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne is par arz kya ke aap ye mujhey pahnney ke liye inayat farma rahe hain. halanke aap khud utaarid ke hullon ke barey mein jo kuchh farmana tha farma chukey hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke maine usey tumhen pahnney ke liye nahi diya hai. chunanche umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne usey apne aik mushrik bhai ko de diya, jo makke mein rehta tha."
"2613","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ke ghar tashrif le gaey, lekin andar nahi gaey. iske baad Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ghar aaey to Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ne zikr kya (ke Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ghar mein tashrif nahi laey ( Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne iska zikr jab Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kya to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke maine uske darwazey par dhaarii daar parda latkaa dekha tha (is liye wapas chala aayaa) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke mujhey duniya (ki aaraaish w zebaaish) se kya sarokaar. Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ne aa kar unse Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki guftgu ka zikr kya to unhon-ne kaha ke aap mujhey jis tarah ka chaahein is silsiley mein hukm farmaein . (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko jab ye baat pahunchi to) Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke falan ghar mein usey bhijwa dein. unhein uski zarurat hai."
"2614","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey aik reshamii hulla hadiye mein diya to maine usey pahan liya. lekin jab ghussey ke aasaar chehre par dekhey to usey apni aurton mein phaad kar taqseem kar diya."
"2616","dauma (Tabook ke qareeb aik maqaam) ke Akeedar ( nasrani ( ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hadiya bheja tha."
"2617","aik Yahudi aurat Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein zahar mila hua bakri ka gosht laaii, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne usmein se kuchh khaya (lekin fauran hi farmaya ke usmein zahar padaa hua hai) phir jab usey laya gaya (aur usne zahar dalney ka iqrar bhi kar liyaa) to kaha gaya ke kyon na usey qatl kar diya jaey. lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke nahi. us zahar ka asar maine hamesha Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke taaloo mein mehsus kya."
"2618","ham aik so tees (130) aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath (eik safar mein) they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya kya kisi ke sath khaney ki bhi koi cheez hai? aik sahabi ke sath taqriban aik saa khana ( aata ( tha. wo aata goondhaa gaya. phir aik lambaa-tadangaa mushrik pareshan haal bakriyan haanktaa hua aaya. to Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ye bechney ke liye hain. ya kisi ka Atiya hai ya aap ne (atiya ki bajaey) hiba farmaya, usne kaha ke nahi bechney ke liye hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us se aik bakri kharidi phir wo zabah ki gaee. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne uski kalejii bhoonney ke liye kaha, qism Allah ki aik so tees ashaab mein se har aik ko us kalejii mein se kaat ke diya. jo maujood they unhein to Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne fauran hi de diya aur jo us waqt maujood nahi they unka hissey mehfooz rakh liya. phir bakri ke gosht ko 2 badi piyaalon mein rakha gaya aur sab ne khub sair ho kar khaayaa. jo kuchh piyaalon mein bach gaya tha usey oont par rakh kar ham wapas laey. ya isi tarah kuch kaha."
"2619","umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne dekha ke aik shakhs ke yahan aik reshamii joda bik raha hai. to aap ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se kaha ke aap ye joda khareed lijiye taake Juma ke din aur jab koi wafad aaey to aap usey pehna karein. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke usey to wo log pahntey hain jinka aakhirat mein koi hissey nahi hota. phir Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas bahut se reshamii jodey aaey aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne unmein se aik joda umr (Raziallahu anhu) ko bhejaa. umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha ke main isey kis tarah pahan sakta hun jabke aap khud hi iske mutaalliq jo kuchh irshad farmana tha, farma chukey hain. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke maine tumhen pahnney ke liye nahi diya balke isliye diya ke tum isey bech do ya kisi (ghair muslim) ko pehna do. chunanche umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne usey Makke main apne aik bhai ke ghar bhej diya jo abhi Islam nahi laya tha."
"2620","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney mein meri walida (Qutaila- binte- abdul-Uzzaa) jo mushrika thin, mere yahan aaiin. maine Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se poochha, maine ye bhi kaha ke wo (mujh se mulaqat ki) bahut khaahishmand hain, to kya main apni walida ke sath sila rehmii kar sakti hoon? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke haan, apni walida ke sath sila rehmii kar."
"2621","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''apnaa diya hua hadiya wapas leney wala aisa hai jaisey apni ki hui qai ko chaatney waalaa.''"
"2622","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''ham musalmanon ko buri misal na ikhtiyar karni chahiye us shakhs ki si jo apna diya hua hadiya wapas ley ley, wo us kuttey ki tarah hai jo apni qai khud chaatta hai.''"
"2623","unhon-ne umr bin-Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) se suna. aap ne farmaya ke maine aik ghoda Allah ke rastey mein jihad ke liye (eik shakhs ko) diyaa). jisey maine wo ghoda diya tha, us ne usey dublaa kar diya. isliye mera irada hua ke us se apna wo ghoda khareed loon, mera ye bhi khayal tha ke wo shakhs wo ghoda sastey daamon par bech dega. lekin jab maine iske barey mein Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha to aap ne farmaya ke tum usey na khareedo, chahe tumhen wo aik hi dirham mein kyon na de. kyonke apne sadqe ko wapas leney wala shakhs us kuttey ki tarah hai jo apni hi qai khud chaatta hai."
"2624","2 makan aur aik hujra Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Suheb (Raziallahu anhu) ko inayat farmaya tha (jo wiraasat mein unhein milnaa chahiye ( khaleefa Marwaan-bin-Hakam ne puchha ke tumharey haq mein us da'wey par gawah kon hai? unhon-ne kaha ke Abdullah-bin-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) . Marwan ne aapko bulaya to aap ne gawahi di ke waqei Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Suheb (Raziallahu anhu) ko 2 makan aur aik hujra diya tha. Marwan ne aap ki gawahi par faisla unke haq mein kar diya."
"2625","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne umra ke mutaalliq faisla kya tha ke wo uska ho jata hai jisey hiba kya gaya ho."
"2626","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''umraa jaaiz hai.'' aur Ata ne kaha ke mujh se Jaabir (Raziallahu anhu) ne Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se isi tarah bayan kya."
"2627","Madiney par (dushman ke hamley ka ( khof tha. isliye Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne abu-Talha (Raziallahu anhu) se aik ghoda jiska naam mandoob tha mus'taar liya, phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) is par Sawar huey (sahaaba bhi sath they) phir jab wapas huey to farmaya, hamein to koi khatre ki cheez nazar na aaii, albatta ye ghoda samandar ki tarah (tez daudtaa) paya."
"2628","main Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ki khidmat mein hazir hua to aap Qitr ( Yaman ka aik dabeez khurdaraa kapda ( ki qamees qeemtii panch dirham ki pahney huey thin. aap ne (mujh se) farmaya, zara nazar utha kar meri us londi ko to dekh. usey ghar mein bhi ye kapdey pahnney se inkar hai. halanke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke zamaney mein mere paas usi ki aik qamees thi. jab koi ladki dulhan banai jati to mere yahan aadmi bhej kar wo qamees aariyatan mangaa leti thi."
"2629","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, kya hi umda hai hadiya us doodh dene wali ontni ka jisne abhi haal hi mein bachcha janaa ho aur doodh dene wali bakri ka jo subah w Sham apne doodh se bartan bhar deti hai. ham se Abdullaah-bin-Yoosuf aur Ismail ne bayan kya, unse Imam Malik ne bayan kya ke (doodh dene wali ontni ka ( sadqa kya hi umda hai."
"2630","jab muhajireen Makka se Madina aaey to unke sath koi bhi saman na tha. Ansar zameen aur jaaidaad waley they. Ansar ne muhajireen se ye mamla kar liya ke wo apne baghaat mein se unhein har saal phal diya karengey aur uske badley muhajireen unke baghaat mein kaam kya karein. Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ki walida Umme-Sulaim jo Abdullaah-bin-abii-Tal'ha (Raziallahu anhu) ki bhi walida thin, unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko khajoor ka aik baagh hadiya de diya tha lekin Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne wo baagh apni londi umme-Aiman (Raziallahu anhu) jo Usama-bin-Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) ki walida thin, inayat farma diya. ibne-Shahab ne bayan kya ke mujhey Anas-bin-Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ne khabar di ke Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab khaibar ke yahudiyon ki jang se farigh huey aur Madina tashrif laey to muhajireen ne Ansar ko unke tohfey wapas kar diye jo unhon-ne phalon ki sura mein de rakhey they. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ki walida ka baagh bhi wapas kar diya aur umme-Aiman (Raziallahu anhu) ko iske bajaey apne baagh mein se (kuchh darakht) inayat farma diye. Ahmed bin shabeeb ne bayan kya, unhein unke walid ne khabar di aur unhein Yunus ne isi tarah albatta apni riwayat mein bajaaey (مكانهن من حائطه) ke (مكانهن من خالصه‏) bayaan kya."
"2631","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya, chalis (40) khaslatein jin mein sabse aalaa w buland. doodh dene wali bakri ka hadiya karna hai. aisi hain ke jo shakhs unmein se aik khaslat par bhi aamil hoga sawab ki niyat se aur Allah ke waadey ko sachcha samajhtey huey to Allah Taala uski wjah se usey jannat mein dakhil karega. Hassan ne kaha ke doodh dene wali bakri ke hadiye ko chhod kar ham ne salam ka jawab denaa, chheenkney waley ka jawab dena aur takleef dene wali cheez ko rastey se hata dene wghaira ka shumaar kya, to sab pandarah khaslatein bhi ham shumaar na kar sakey."
"2632","ham mein se bahut se ashaab ke paas faaltu zameen bhi thi, unhon-ne kaha tha ke tehai ya chothai ya nisf ki batai par ham kyon na usey de diya karein. is par Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''jiske paas zameen ho to usey khud bonii chahiye ya phir kisi apne bhai ko hadiya kar deni chahiye aur agar aisa nahi karta to phir zameen apne paas rakhey rahe.''"
"2633","aik dehati Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hua aur Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se hijrat ke liye poochha. Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya'' Allah tum par raham kare. hijrat ka to bada hi dushwar mamla hai. tumharey paas oont bhi hai?'' unhon-ne kaha ji haan! Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya'' aur iska sadqa (zakaat) bhi ada kartey ho?'' unhon-ne kaha ji haan! Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ''usmein se kuchh hadiya bhi detey ho? ''unhon-ne kaha ji haan! Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya'' to tum usey pani pilaaney ke liye ghaat par ley janey waley din dohtey hogey?'' unhon-ne kaha ji haan! phir Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''samandaron ke paar bhi agar tum amal karogey to Allah Taala tumharey amal mein se koi cheez kam nahi karega.''"
"2634","Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aik martaba aisey khet ki taraf tashrif le gaey jiski kheti lahlaha rahi thi, Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne malum farmaya ''ye kis ka hai?'' sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ne batlaya ke falan ne usey kiraaye par liya hai. is par Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''agar wo hadiyatan de deta to us se behtar tha ke is par aik muqarrara ujrat wsool kartaa.''"
"2635","Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''Ibraaheem (Alaihissalam) ne Saara (Alaihissalam) ke sath hijrat ki to unhein badshah ne Aajar ko (yani Hajra (Alaihissalam) ko) Atiya mein de diya. phir wo wapas huin aur Ibrahim se kaha, dekha aap ne Allah Taala ne kaafir ko kis tarah zaleel kya aur aik ladki khidmat ke liye bhi de di. Ibne-Sirin ne kaha, unse Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ne aur unse Nabi Karim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne bayan kya ke badshah ne Hajra ko unki khidmat ke liye de diya tha."
"2636","maine apne bap se suna wo bayan kartey they ke umr (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha maine aik ghoda Allah ke rastey mein jihad ke liye aik shakhs ko de diya tha, phir maine dekha ke wo usey bech raha hai. isliye maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se puchha ke usey waapasi mein hi khareed loon? Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ''is ghodey ko na khareed. apna diya hua sadqa wapas na lo.''"